  "description": "Compile-time object mapping for .NET via Roslyn source generators. Add [Map(typeof(Dto))] to your domain class — AutoMap generates strongly-typed ToDto() extension methods at build time. Zero reflection, zero startup overhead, AOT-safe, MAUI-compatible. Supports nested objects, collections, records, structs, enums, flattening, reverse mapping, and conditional mapping. Build-time diagnostics (AM001–AM007) catch mistakes at compile time, not runtime. Drop-in AutoMapper alternative; no profiles, no IMapper, no DI required. Attribute-first ergonomics — annotate once, call the extension method everywhere.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
